0111\u00f4 th\u1ecb Vi\u1ec7t Nam (ICD Cabin Technology)<\/strong>, \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p <strong>cabin nh\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, b\u1ed1t g\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, ch\u00f2i g\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, cabin nh\u00e0 v\u1ec7 sinh, tr\u1ea1m thu ph\u00ed<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nh\u00f4m k\u00ednh, inox, khung th\u00e9p hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i sang tr\u1ecdng, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn, l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ngay sau khi l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t.<\/p>\n<p>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m mang t\u00ednh nh\u00e2n v\u0103n cao gi\u00fap n\u00e2ng cao s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<p>Ngo\u00e0i ra ch\u00fang t\u00f4i c\u00f2n s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t gia c\u00f4ng <a href=\"http:\/\/dailythungrac.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">th\u00f9ng r\u00e1c<\/a>, xe thu gom r\u00e1c, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.nhavesinh.vn\/p_category\/nha-ve-sinh-di-dong.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nh\u00e0 v\u1ec7 sinh di \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/a>, <strong>thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u1ec7 sinh m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f4 th\u1ecb c\u00f4ng c\u1ed9ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i cam k\u1ebft cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 h\u1ee3p l\u00fd v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 chu \u0111\u00e1o nh\u1ea5t t\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<br \/>\n<strong>>> Xem th\u00eam<\/strong>: <a href=\"http:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/category\/du-an\/\">C\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>C\u00f4ng ty CP ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f4 th\u1ecb Vi\u1ec7t Nam (ICD Cabin Technology), \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p cabin nh\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, b\u1ed1t g\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, ch\u00f2i g\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, cabin nh\u00e0 v\u1ec7 sinh, tr\u1ea1m thu ph\u00ed. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nh\u00f4m k\u00ednh, inox, khung th\u00e9p hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i sang tr\u1ecdng, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/21"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=21"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/21\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":966,"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/21\/revisions\/966"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=21"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":2,"date":"2015-11-28T08:09:36","date_gmt":"2015-11-28T08:09:36","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/cabin.vn\/?page_id=2"},"modified":"2015-12-16T03:25:05","modified_gmt":"2015-12-16T03:25:05","slug":"lien-he","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/cabinbaove.vn\/lien-he\/","title":{"rendered":"Li\u00ean h\u1ec7"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>C\u00e1m \u01a1n qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi trang th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i r\u1ea5t vui khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb qu\u00fd v\u1ecb.<\/p>\n<p>B\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 th\u1eafc m\u1eafc v\u00e0 g\u00f3p \u00fd \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00f4ng ty xin vui l\u00f2ng li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi ch\u00f